{"id":"vod_sn_38440","vodId":"38440","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"这个丑陋又美丽的世界","name_cn":"这个丑陋又美丽的世界","date":"2004-01-01","year":"2004","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"全12集","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/694d09af2a22e37a0bbcd8b287e5effe.jpg"},"summary":"竹本武（水岛大宙 配音）是一个充满了正义感的普通少年。某一日，森林中的一个发光物体吸引了武的注意，随后，少女光（川澄绫子 配音）从光芒之中破茧而出。光的存在给武带来了许多的快乐，但她的神秘身世一直都像一道阴影一样投射在两人的生活中。　　与此同时，一位名叫明（清水爱 配音）的少女和竹本武亲梅竹马的好友二之宫良（泷本富士子 配音）相遇了，就这样，天真善良的四人渡过了一段无忧无虑的时光。可是好景不长，原来，光是为了毁灭地球而被制造的武器，当暴虐的本性无法再隐藏之时，明和武不得不为了保护地球而站在了光的对立面。一边是世界的和平，一边是自己心爱的女孩，武会做出怎样的选择呢？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-08-02 09:24:22","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v13.rstu6.com/202608/02/AJzT6xrZv827/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v13.rstu6.com/202608/02/JM5DnmjLCH27/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v14.rstu6.com/202608/02/THx0ePp36s27/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v13.rstu6.com/202608/02/aNJyBBzec127/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v14.rstu6.com/202608/02/LzxNVx3jrk27/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v14.rstu6.com/202608/02/skgUuv4whV27/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v13.rstu6.com/202608/02/DUjCqZCwKy27/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v13.rstu6.com/202608/02/LHz7pUyUxA27/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v13.rstu6.com/202608/02/HwhmgXXbwP27/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v13.rstu6.com/202608/02/72Kp9MZ7mR27/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v14.rstu6.com/202608/02/L4c44PPKpK27/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v14.rstu6.com/202608/02/tWXQymXp9i27/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:37.448Z"}